# Absolute path or "~/..." to the directory where audit reports are written.
# The `write`-role tools clear/save cowork-audit-YYYY-MM-DD.md files here.
MCP_CLAUDE_HOUSEKEEPING_PATH=~/Documents/Claude/Projects/Claude Housekeeping

# Optional: comma-separated list of enabled roles. Allowed: read, write.
# Defaults to "read" only when unset (least privilege). Set to "read,write"
# to also expose the destructive write-role tools (prune, relocate, delete).
# Each tool's role is derived from its MCP annotations (readOnlyHint), not
# its name; see src/utils/roles.ts.
# MCP_CLAUDE_HOUSEKEEPING_ROLES=read,write
